WEBVTT

00:00:37.350 --> 00:00:40.310
2 Years Ago

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:54.860
Gai!

00:00:59.450 --> 00:01:02.870
The MechaLion, later named Galeon, was secretly subjected to...

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:07.290
...a full mechanical overhaul by the Space Development Corporation.

00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:11.920
For those of us on Earth, Galeon was the...

00:01:12.050 --> 00:01:14.510
...first messenger to arrive from an alien civilization.

00:01:14.630 --> 00:01:19.260
But despite the valiant efforts of SDC scientists, he remained immobile...

00:01:19.430 --> 00:01:23.560
...and showed no signs of responding to any type of contact.

00:01:24.730 --> 00:01:28.690
Our data tells us that this block is entirely independent...

00:01:28.860 --> 00:01:31.980
...and has nothing to do whatsoever with the MechaLion's functions.

00:01:32.650 --> 00:01:37.410
On top of that, there's also a shield preventing internal transmittance.

00:01:37.530 --> 00:01:41.580
Hmm, so it really is a black box, isn't it?

00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:46.660
Galeon, tell us why you came to Earth.

00:01:52.960 --> 00:01:53.710
What is this?

00:02:03.850 --> 00:02:07.560
What appeared at that moment was a diagram illustrating technology...

00:02:07.690 --> 00:02:10.560
...of the highest order, far beyond the scope of human understanding.

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:14.650
It was with the technology provided to them at this time that...

00:02:14.780 --> 00:02:19.200
<i>...man</i> was able to build the GS-Ride, as well as GaoGaiGar.

00:02:23.240 --> 00:02:26.240
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:02:26.240 --> 00:02:29.140
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:30.170 --> 00:02:36.090
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:02:36.490 --> 00:02:40.140
Rise in fury, Steel Cyborg!

00:02:42.260 --> 00:02:46.860
With your red mane and golden arms!

00:02:48.180 --> 00:02:51.140
Your G-Stone sparkling in the sun...

00:02:51.140 --> 00:02:56.060
All the world's hope is in your hands.

00:02:56.060 --> 00:02:59.980
Your time has come to make a stand!

00:02:59.980 --> 00:03:02.780
Crushing the hopes of the people...

00:03:02.780 --> 00:03:06.540
The Zonders will pay the price!

00:03:08.690 --> 00:03:11.540
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:03:11.540 --> 00:03:14.710
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:03:14.710 --> 00:03:17.250
Final Fusion, approved!

00:03:17.450 --> 00:03:20.380
Now transform into a superhero!

00:03:20.380 --> 00:03:23.340
Warping dimensional space!

00:03:23.590 --> 00:03:27.420
Dividing Driver!

00:03:29.240 --> 00:03:35.060
A miracle! A mystery! The truth! A dream!

00:03:35.060 --> 00:03:40.940
A gigantic, invincible guardian is born!

00:03:40.940 --> 00:03:43.890
Our very own King of Braves!

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:47.780
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:03:47.240 --> 00:03:49.830
This is the story of the brave men and women...

00:03:49.950 --> 00:03:52.790
...who fight with all their hearts to save mankind.

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:55.210
The Legacy of Cain

00:03:56.340 --> 00:03:57.500
<i>The Legacy of Cain</i>

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:18.230
Waha!

00:04:18.610 --> 00:04:19.900
Hey, did you see that, Hana?

00:04:19.980 --> 00:04:22.740
Yeah! That's the Shooting Coaster, right?

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:26.410
It's so awesome! I can't wait to ride it!

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:31.080
Hey there! Mamoru! Hana!

00:04:31.370 --> 00:04:33.460
Look, I got you your tickets!

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:36.630
They said you'd have a 2-hour wait.

00:04:37.460 --> 00:04:39.130
Do we really have to wait that long?

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:43.170
Oh, that's okay. There are tons of other rides I want go on...

00:04:43.300 --> 00:04:45.380
The 2 hours will be up in no time!

00:04:45.590 --> 00:04:46.300
I guess you're right.

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:54.560
An immense marine amusement park built on a man-made island...

00:04:54.690 --> 00:04:56.600
...in the sea near Okinawa...

00:04:57.650 --> 00:05:00.650
...it is called the Waterpolis!

00:05:02.030 --> 00:05:04.950
But little did the Amamis and Hana know that...

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:08.620
...even as they were enjoying this peaceful day...

00:05:09.280 --> 00:05:13.200
...a Zonderian conspiracy was brewing...

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:19.290
Both Penchinon and Pizza seem intimidated by that child, but...

00:05:19.420 --> 00:05:21.170
...that's not the case with me.

00:05:21.590 --> 00:05:27.130
I intend to take full advantage of that boy's existence...

00:05:27.340 --> 00:05:30.510
President of the Space Development Corporation...

00:05:30.760 --> 00:05:35.020
...and Chief of the Gutsy Geoid Guard, Kohtaroh Taiga!

00:05:35.770 --> 00:05:36.480
Yes, sir!

00:05:37.650 --> 00:05:42.610
That same day, the leaders of GGG were attending a...

00:05:42.780 --> 00:05:49.280
...Diet meeting to answer questions on the war with the Zonderians.

00:05:50.990 --> 00:05:55.710
In answer to your questions regarding the earlier Zonderian...

00:05:56.040 --> 00:05:58.170
...interference with the Isolde particle accelerator...

00:05:58.710 --> 00:05:59.830
Hey, Major,

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:01.840
I'm just as bored as you are.

00:06:02.090 --> 00:06:03.670
Just hang on a little longer...

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:06.550
I never said I was bored...

00:06:07.050 --> 00:06:09.890
They've already got GGG in their sights for being a money pit...

00:06:10.010 --> 00:06:12.510
...and for withholding information.

00:06:12.890 --> 00:06:15.060
We've got to pay them some lip service from time to time...

00:06:15.180 --> 00:06:18.390
...or they won't give us the funding we need for new machines...

00:06:18.560 --> 00:06:19.770
Oh, man...

00:06:20.730 --> 00:06:24.360
Hey, by the way, Mamoru's off in Okinawa, right?

00:06:25.030 --> 00:06:27.240
What if a Zonder tries to attack him there?

00:06:27.700 --> 00:06:29.070
Don't worry about it, Major.

00:06:29.360 --> 00:06:31.410
You know who's got Mamoru's back...

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:34.330
Huh! Guess you're right...

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:50.220
Keep going, keep going!

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:52.010
Don't let him beat you! Come on!

00:06:53.430 --> 00:06:55.510
Waha! Looks like I win, Dad!

00:06:59.980 --> 00:07:02.560
Waha! I'm the man!

00:07:03.150 --> 00:07:04.150
Hey, gimme a break!

00:07:04.270 --> 00:07:07.820
You never would've had a chance if I hadn't messed up at the end!

00:07:07.940 --> 00:07:11.450
Waha! Come on, Mamoru, don't be such a sore loser!

00:07:11.570 --> 00:07:13.410
I'm not being a sore loser!

00:07:13.620 --> 00:07:15.490
Those two are exactly alike!

00:07:15.580 --> 00:07:17.790
It's just like they say, like father, like son!

00:07:18.540 --> 00:07:19.330
Huh?

00:07:19.790 --> 00:07:21.620
Oh, um, I suppose so.

00:07:21.710 --> 00:07:22.960
Hey! Hey, Mom!

00:07:23.460 --> 00:07:24.840
Isn't it almost time?

00:07:24.960 --> 00:07:26.630
Come on, let's go over to the Shooting Coaster!

00:07:27.880 --> 00:07:29.170
Oh, yes, that's right.

00:07:29.880 --> 00:07:32.090
You and Hana run along, then.

00:07:32.340 --> 00:07:34.930
Your father and I will be waiting down here.

00:07:35.550 --> 00:07:36.640
Okay!

00:07:38.140 --> 00:07:39.350
Here you go, Ai.

00:07:39.640 --> 00:07:40.810
Thank you, dear.

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:43.980
Father and son!

00:07:55.120 --> 00:07:56.120
Come on, or we'll be eaten!

00:07:56.200 --> 00:07:56.990
Wait!

00:08:00.580 --> 00:08:03.170
He's got a baby in his mouth!

00:08:03.540 --> 00:08:05.000
Hey, hey. wait!

00:08:27.270 --> 00:08:32.860
Why don't we go on a ride while we're waiting for Mamoru and Hana?

00:08:33.820 --> 00:08:34.820
Good idea.

00:08:34.910 --> 00:08:36.620
Why not have some fun of our own?

00:08:37.320 --> 00:08:38.740
How about that one there?

00:08:38.830 --> 00:08:40.620
Oh! That looks like fun!

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:51.340
Hey! It's Uppo, kids!

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:55.180
Uppo! Uppo! Uppo!

00:08:55.340 --> 00:08:57.090
Whoa! That is so lame.

00:08:59.010 --> 00:09:00.100
Come on, Hana, let's go!

00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:01.020
Yeah!

00:09:11.650 --> 00:09:13.280
Jeez, I've had enough of this!

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:17.200
This job is killing me!

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:20.950
Having to wear this stupid costume in this horrible heat!

00:09:23.410 --> 00:09:25.040
I want to have some fun, too!

00:09:25.370 --> 00:09:28.460
Wish I could ride that Shooting Coaster...

00:09:28.960 --> 00:09:32.420
Ah, I see you are deeply troubled, my friend.

00:09:33.630 --> 00:09:35.090
Who the heck are you?

00:09:35.840 --> 00:09:37.340
I think I can accommodate you.

00:09:37.510 --> 00:09:41.010
I'll be happy to grant you your wish.

00:09:41.140 --> 00:09:43.970
Go on and ride that rollercoaster to your heart's content!

00:09:49.060 --> 00:09:53.440
We will now be launching the Shooting Coaster.

00:09:53.650 --> 00:09:58.660
Enjoy this thrilling adventure... the pride of Waterpolis Amusement Park!

00:10:03.290 --> 00:10:05.750
Hey, this isn't anything to scream about at all!

00:10:05.830 --> 00:10:08.620
What are you talking about, Mamoru? It hasn't started yet!

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:23.720
I'm not afraid! I'm not afraid!

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:30.940
Waha!

00:10:34.440 --> 00:10:35.610
Mermaids!

00:10:35.730 --> 00:10:37.700
They're just 3-D images, Mamoru!

00:10:39.990 --> 00:10:41.740
Is that just a 3-D image, too?

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:43.450
I think so!

00:10:43.530 --> 00:10:46.290
This Shooting Coaster's everything it's cracked up to be!

00:10:47.870 --> 00:10:49.290
Is that Uppo?

00:10:49.330 --> 00:10:51.380
It's not a 3-D image!

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:53.790
But this ride could use a little boost.

00:10:54.210 --> 00:10:56.630
Something like this!

00:11:06.680 --> 00:11:08.390
Uppo!

00:11:09.850 --> 00:11:11.350
What a blast!

00:11:15.820 --> 00:11:17.440
Uppo!

00:11:25.700 --> 00:11:26.790
It's Galeon!

00:11:26.990 --> 00:11:29.160
Something must've happened to Mamoru!

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:29.830
What?

00:11:30.790 --> 00:11:32.500
Oh, man, not when the Chief's not around!

00:11:32.960 --> 00:11:35.380
Triple-decked Flying Carrier, launch!

00:12:20.920 --> 00:12:26.680
The greatest obstacle to our goals, the Legacy of Cain, that MechaLion!

00:12:27.260 --> 00:12:32.100
Let us use that child as bait to lure the MechaLion into our hands!

00:12:38.570 --> 00:12:42.360
The Vehicle Machine called Volfogg, of the GGG Intelligence Unit...

00:12:42.990 --> 00:12:46.280
...has been charged with the duty of protecting Mamoru Amami.

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:48.870
System Change!

00:13:00.340 --> 00:13:03.090
Volfogg!

00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:06.550
Uppo!

00:13:08.220 --> 00:13:10.060
Silver Moon!

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:15.480
Uppo!

00:13:54.140 --> 00:13:55.140
I must stop him!

00:13:55.270 --> 00:13:56.850
Or else Special Agent Mamoru will be drowned!

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:00.810
What is that?

00:14:04.860 --> 00:14:05.820
Galeon!

00:14:06.200 --> 00:14:07.740
Ah, here he comes.

00:14:07.910 --> 00:14:10.240
To the rail-less Terminal Station...

00:14:17.920 --> 00:14:18.920
Galeon!

00:14:26.130 --> 00:14:27.300
Thank you, Galeon!

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:29.890
Watch out!

00:14:37.270 --> 00:14:38.310
Galeon!

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:41.860
...this should leave no question whatsoever that...

00:14:41.940 --> 00:14:43.730
...as members of the Gutsy Geoid Guard...

00:14:43.940 --> 00:14:46.650
...our duty to guarantee the safety of the people...

00:14:52.490 --> 00:14:53.160
Your Excellency!

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:57.750
I've just received word that an alien life-form, a Zonderian, is now...

00:14:57.830 --> 00:15:00.330
...rampaging over the Okinawa Waterpolis park!

00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:02.540
I, Kohtaroh Taiga, along with my deputies...

00:15:02.630 --> 00:15:05.500
...respectfully request permission to return to our GGG duties!

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:09.720
GGG Mobile Unit...

00:15:10.220 --> 00:15:11.340
Let's go!

00:15:11.720 --> 00:15:13.010
Right!

00:15:13.140 --> 00:15:14.430
Come on!

00:15:20.770 --> 00:15:24.690
We're going back to the Main Order Room with HyoRyu and EnRyu.

00:15:25.190 --> 00:15:26.940
Gai, I want you to head for Okinawa ASAP!

00:15:27.230 --> 00:15:28.530
Roger that!

00:15:28.990 --> 00:15:30.360
GaoMachines!

00:15:43.080 --> 00:15:43.830
All right!

00:15:46.710 --> 00:15:47.750
Captain!

00:15:48.460 --> 00:15:49.460
Thanks!

00:15:58.140 --> 00:15:59.600
Don't let him get you, Galeon!

00:16:03.270 --> 00:16:06.440
If I miss with this, I could cause injury to Galeon as well!

00:16:08.360 --> 00:16:09.480
I've locked my sights...

00:16:09.570 --> 00:16:12.110
Silver Cross!

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:20.450
All right!

00:16:20.910 --> 00:16:23.080
I must transport Special Agent Mamoru and the civilians to safety...

00:16:23.210 --> 00:16:26.380
...before that Zonder Robo regenerates!

00:16:30.510 --> 00:16:31.800
Uppo!

00:16:34.800 --> 00:16:36.640
Uppo!

00:16:39.010 --> 00:16:40.270
Uppo!

00:16:50.030 --> 00:16:50.900
Big Brother Gai!

00:16:51.400 --> 00:16:54.610
Equip!

00:17:00.950 --> 00:17:02.450
Sorry to keep you waiting, Mamoru!

00:17:02.580 --> 00:17:03.910
Let's go, Galeon!

00:17:05.370 --> 00:17:07.960
Fusion!

00:17:18.260 --> 00:17:21.850
GaiGar!

00:17:33.240 --> 00:17:34.900
Fog Gas!

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:39.740
Double Boomerang!

00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:57.130
So he fell for it.

00:17:57.220 --> 00:18:01.310
That is merely an illusion created by my Projection Beam.

00:18:02.010 --> 00:18:03.140
Awesome!

00:18:03.310 --> 00:18:04.770
Who in the world are you?

00:18:05.310 --> 00:18:07.190
I'll introduce myself properly later.

00:18:07.640 --> 00:18:10.940
Now then, GaiGar! This is your chance to achieve Final Fusion!

00:18:11.110 --> 00:18:11.900
Right!

00:18:12.020 --> 00:18:13.860
Hey, I owe you big time, Volfogg!

00:18:14.990 --> 00:18:16.280
Volfogg?

00:18:16.780 --> 00:18:20.530
Final Fusion!

00:19:06.240 --> 00:19:10.170
GaoGaiGar!

00:19:12.920 --> 00:19:14.540
Bring it on, Zonder!

00:19:14.800 --> 00:19:16.760
The battle is only just beginning now!

00:19:21.220 --> 00:19:22.680
A contest of strength, huh?

00:19:22.760 --> 00:19:23.600
Sounds like fun!

00:19:54.420 --> 00:19:56.960
Broken Magnum!

00:20:14.810 --> 00:20:17.400
Protect Shade!

00:20:53.850 --> 00:20:55.350
GaoGaiGar!

00:20:55.900 --> 00:20:58.690
Hell and Heaven!

00:21:06.030 --> 00:21:07.820
I believe it's all over now.

00:21:11.410 --> 00:21:14.290
Now, then, Special Agent Mamoru, if you please.

00:21:14.500 --> 00:21:15.670
Oh, right.

00:21:21.840 --> 00:21:24.340
Curatio...

00:21:24.630 --> 00:21:28.050
Teneritas, sectio...

00:21:28.390 --> 00:21:32.520
...salus, coctura!

00:21:40.650 --> 00:21:42.650
Curse that Legacy of Cain!

00:21:46.200 --> 00:21:49.280
Hey, that was harder than we thought!

00:21:49.830 --> 00:21:51.740
Really, thanks to your getting so lost in there...

00:21:52.240 --> 00:21:55.710
...look how much time it took us to get out!

00:22:03.340 --> 00:22:05.050
What on Earth...

00:22:07.260 --> 00:22:08.510
Oh! Honey, look up there!

00:22:18.230 --> 00:22:21.940
You were right! It's that North Pole Lion again!

00:22:22.230 --> 00:22:23.400
Mamoru!

00:22:23.530 --> 00:22:24.610
Mamoru, dear!

00:22:24.780 --> 00:22:25.860
Hey!

00:22:26.320 --> 00:22:29.160
What's the matter, Mom? Dad?

00:22:30.410 --> 00:22:33.540
Volfogg, of the GGG Intelligence Unit...

00:22:34.080 --> 00:22:41.210
The time will come when we discover his secret supernatural powers!

00:22:46.410 --> 00:22:50.310
You come floating down onto my planet.

00:22:51.510 --> 00:22:55.180
That's the dream I always have.

00:22:56.580 --> 00:23:01.360
Now you're looking up at the sky again...

00:23:01.360 --> 00:23:06.150
and you're searching for me.

00:23:06.780 --> 00:23:10.320
Longing to see you and be with you...

00:23:11.490 --> 00:23:17.250
I know I feel it just as strongly as you.

00:23:19.310 --> 00:23:24.010
Give us the wings to fly

00:23:24.010 --> 00:23:28.670
and set off into the galaxy.

00:23:29.360 --> 00:23:34.010
When you and I are grown up...

00:23:34.010 --> 00:23:40.910
someday in the Sea of Stars.

00:23:45.440 --> 00:23:48.990
Now releasing the latest intelligence.

00:23:49.110 --> 00:23:51.240
Trapped in a strange fog, Mamoru and his friends find themselves...

00:23:51.320 --> 00:23:54.280
...under attack by a state-of-the-art tank and chopper!

00:23:54.910 --> 00:23:58.620
You must protect them! Brave Robot Volfogg of the Intelligence Unit...

00:23:58.910 --> 00:24:02.540
At last, his ultimate secrets will be revealed to us!

00:24:03.330 --> 00:24:05.540
Next episode of GaoGaiGar, King of Braves...

00:24:05.630 --> 00:24:07.420
"The Misty Valley"

00:24:06.750 --> 00:24:10.420
The Misty Valley

00:24:07.500 --> 00:24:10.420
Make sure you stay tuned for the order..."Final Fusion Approved!"

00:24:12.430 --> 00:24:15.390
GunDober & GunGlue

00:24:13.260 --> 00:24:14.930
This is the Key to Victory!
